OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright or sunny intervals and a
OL,6,Ffew showers, these showers more
OL,7,Ffrequent over western Perthshire and
OL,8,Fthe Trossachs, with the best of the
OL,9,Fsunshine towards Angus.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThe east will be mainly dry
OL,12,Fwith clear spells this evening while a
OL,13,Ffew showers affect the west. Overnight
OL,14,Fshowers will become a little more
OL,15,Fwidespread, some heavy.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FA cloudier day with more
OL,18,Ffrequent showers, some on the heavy
OL,19,Fside, best of the sunnier spells
OL,20,Ftowards Dundee and Fife. Strong
OL,21,Fwesterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
